      "versionNonce": 677594770,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786808575585,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "属于想出来的一种办法\n\n同时也是一个目的（解\n答出这个问题就是目\n的）",
      "fontSize": 24.617187500000004,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "属于想出来的一种办法\n\n同时也是一个目的（解答出这个问题就是目的）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "t0pNut0F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1466.1953125,
      "y": 165.0693359375,
      "width": 194.6171875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 155225554,
      "version": 337,
      "versionNonce": 2001183630,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786808575585,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如何解答刚刚的问\n题，也许一开始我们\n并不知道如何解答它\n\n这本身也属于想办法\n了，这也是想出来的\n一种办法。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如何解答刚刚的问题，也许一开始我们并不知道如何解答它\n\n这本身也属于想办法了，这也是想出来的一种办法。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wmmcLLIk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1798.34765625,
      "y": 175.4599609375,
      "width": 215.28906249999994,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2035483538,
      "version": 251,
      "versionNonce": 1025549394,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786808575585,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我怎么才能知道是不是\n这个原因，这又是在想\n办法了，那么刚刚的问\n题又产生了一个新的目\n的。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我怎么才能知道是不是这个原因，这又是在想办法了，那么刚刚的问题又产生了一个新的目的。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
